description:
A small lock beside the label of a setting that needs MFA to change (PrivilegedWrite,
): reassignment, credentials, routing, removal. Saving a change to one asks for
step-up first ("Verify and save"). Reads never do.

props.description:
Render endpoint rows as links (a TanStack Router `<Link>` in the app). Return null to
keep a row a plain item. A linked row navigates natively (click, middle-click, Enter);
a click or Enter also selects it.

description:
Sections held in component state: `Root` (the selected value, controlled or uncontrolled;
a rail, chip strip or picker depending on its own width) and `Panel`. For sections that
are routes, use `RouteVerticalTabs`.
